{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.96:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Khaṇḍasumana:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.96:1.1"], "en": "“Having offered a single flower,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.96:1.2"], "en": "for eighty crores of years...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.96:1.3"], "en": "“Having enjoyed the celestial realms,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.96:1.4"], "en": "I have attained Nibbāna with what remained.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.96:1.5"], "en": "… Thus spoke the Elder Khaṇḍasumana.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
